# Muse-Glimmer-30B, full fine-tuning at 128K context on the science-rl runs' 5 nodes: TRAIN_NODES=3 (TP4 training,
# DP = 2 x TRAIN_NODES = 6) and two engine nodes of four TP2 SGLang engines each (8 engines, one of Glimmer's 2 KV
# heads per GPU). The head node (Ray head, driver, gateway, client) is always one of the engine nodes, so trainer
# rank 0, which sends the weight pushes, never shares a node with the client. Glimmer's positions end at 131072 and the
# engines get context_len + 6, so the context is 131066 and a datum at most 131067 tokens, one per GPU microbatch, ten
# per unit. No context parallelism: Glimmer's bridge model slices its own input for it. The fused fp32 head applies
# Glimmer's logit multiplier and softcap; the engines run the fp32 head (the recipe's default with it), FA3, and no
# vision tower (text-only training keeps it frozen, and the HF exports still carry it). The engines' HTTP keep-alive
# comes from miles (SGLANG_TIMEOUT_KEEP_ALIVE=600 for every engine it launches).
# The image alone cannot build Glimmer: pass the Glimmer overlay as job variables, ROOTFS (Megatron-LM with the APIs
# megatron-bridge's Glimmer bridge uses) and EXTRA_SITE (transformers 5.15, that megatron-bridge, the tinker SDK), and
# an HF_HOME that holds the snapshot below with refs/main naming it (deploy/abci/overlays/muse-glimmer/README.md).
# Use: qsub -l select=5:mpiprocs=8 -v PRESET=muse-glimmer-30b-128k,TRAIN_NODES=3,ROOTFS=...,EXTRA_SITE=...,HF_HOME=...
#      deploy/abci/tinker_gateway.pbs
# tinker_gateway.pbs reads this file (it never sources it); a non-empty job variable replaces a value here.
GATEWAY_LAUNCHER=examples/tinker/run_qwen3_6_35b_a3b_gateway.py
MODE=full
# The snapshot under $HF_HOME/hub (HF_SNAPSHOT, when given, wins).
HF_MODEL=meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B
HF_REVISION=a4e59da52a7bc87ae7251dd5545c0dd437c44b68
# Launcher options: NCCL logs at INFO, the glimmer-30b recipe (TP4/EP1 training, TP2 engines, no routing replay, no CP),
# datums of up to 131066 + 1 tokens, one per GPU microbatch, and units of ten such datums.
LAUNCHER_ARGS="--extra-env-vars NCCL_DEBUG=INFO --model-variant glimmer-30b --model-name meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B --tp 4 --context-len 131066 --max-tokens-per-gpu 131067 --max-tokens-per-datum 131067 --unit-token-budget 1310670"
# serve_tinker.py flags, appended last: FA3 attention and no vision tower on the engines, the optimizer's initial lr
# (every optim_step sends its own), and the cache-aware router with the Qwen3.8 gateway's load-balance thresholds.
EXTRA_ARGS="--sglang-attention-backend fa3 --sglang-language-model-only --lr 1e-6 --router-policy cache_aware --router-balance-abs-threshold 16 --router-balance-rel-threshold 1.5"
# The client's deadline for one sample request, in seconds: long reasoning generations at 128K outlast platoon's 600.
TINKER_SAMPLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=1800
